{"id":"fd05db229db936b5","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-limit-point.md","title":"Limit Point","display":"df-limit-point — Limit Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-limit-point","aliases":["58-df-limit-point"],"display":"df-limit-point — Limit Point","depends_on":["[[58-df-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-limit-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-limit-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-limit-point — Limit Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span> (subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span> (point)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (limit-point predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}limit\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{LimitPoint}_S(x,A,X,\\tau) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\cap(A\\setminus\\{x\\})\\neq\\emptyset)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}limit\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{LimitPoint}_S(x,A,X,\\tau) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\cap(A\\setminus\\{x\\})\\neq\\emptyset)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Limit points are accumulation points of a set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimitPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}limit\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{LimitPoint}_S(x,A,X,\\tau) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\to U\\cap(A\\setminus\\{x\\})\\neq\\emptyset)","display":true}],"bytes":822,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-779","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-limit-point.md|58-df-limit-point]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58"]}